NG_TITLES :: [22]string.["Events and relay messages","Deletion requests","Replies and threads","Relay information","Private messages","Names people can share","Comments with explicit scope","Relay-based groups","Git repositories and issues","Event expiration","Authenticate to a relay","Version 2 encryption","Count matching events","Encrypted key backup foundations","Search a relay","Gift wraps","Relay list metadata","Relay pagination metadata","Protected events","Efficient synchronization","File metadata","Authenticate an HTTP request"];
NG_SUMMARY :: [22]string.["The signed event is the common language of Nostr. Parse it, recompute its id, then check its signature.","Authors can ask relays to delete their own events. A deletion request is a signed event, not a command from any reader.","An e tag can mark a root, reply or mention. These markers describe the thread rather than granting authority.","Before subscribing, a client can ask a relay which protocols and limits it declares.","Private messages compose signed and encrypted envelopes. Relays transport ciphertext rather than a public plaintext conversation.","npub, note, nprofile, nevent and naddr turn keys and references into checksummed strings.","A comment names its root and parent. Uppercase scope tags and lowercase parent tags make that relationship explicit.","A relay can host groups with membership, moderation and group-specific rules.","Repository announcements, issues and status events let development work travel as signed Nostr records.","An expiration tag limits how long a relay should serve an event. The exact expiry second is already expired.","A relay sends a fresh challenge. The client signs a kind 22242 event bound to that relay and connection.","A conversation key derives message keys. The receiver checks the MAC before releasing decrypted plaintext.","A COUNT request asks a relay how many events match a filter without downloading every event.","Password-protected key backup needs a costly KDF, a complete encrypted format, and careful memory and key handling.","A search filter asks a relay to match text according to its supported search behavior.","Gift wraps layer a rumor, a signed seal and an outer encrypted envelope, using fresh wrapping keys.","A user can publish the relays they read from and write to, so peers know where to look.","A relay can attach metadata to EOSE so a client can distinguish more available history from a finished page.","A protected event may only be published by its authenticated author, when a relay supports accepting it.","Negentropy helps peers find differences between event sets without downloading the whole shared history.","A signed file-metadata event describes a file and its location, hash, type and related hints.","A signed kind 27235 event can bind an HTTP method, URL, timestamp and optional body digest to a request."];
NG_COVERAGE :: [22]string.["Coax reads and verifies events, matches filters, reads standard tags and metadata, and builds signed events. The NIP-01 page runs five real verification cases.","The production relay advertises NIP-09. Its Coax replacement does not yet implement deletion and tombstones.","Coax reads the root, reply and mention markers of standard event tags.","The Coax relay serves its own NIP-11 document. The production relay publishes a separate capability document.","The production relay advertises NIP-17. The browser encrypted-deck path already uses the existing NIP-44 and gift-wrap plumbing.","Coax encodes and decodes the NIP-19 forms, including bounded TLV references and relay hints. Project pages use the public forms.","Coax has a typed reader for kind 1111 comments and the task-plan, claim and revision tags OpenAgents uses with them.","The production relay advertises NIP-29. The shared Coax relay has not reached group-policy parity.","OpenAgents publishes its work on Nostr. Coax has typed readers for repository, issue and status records, plus OpenAgents project and ordering records.","The Coax relay checks expiration during admission and queries. Its store retains expired replacement heads so older versions do not return.","Coax handles challenges, canonical relay URLs, event templates, signature checks, connection generations and AUTH routing.","Coax implements NIP-44 v2 payload encryption and decryption, and conversation-key derivation from validated x-only ECDH.","The production relay advertises NIP-45. The Coax R1 relay currently reports COUNT as unsupported.","Coax has a resumable scrypt foundation for NIP-49, bounded workspaces and independent vector checks. This page exercises its buffer-admission helper.","The production relay advertises NIP-50 search. The Coax replacement has not implemented its search behavior.","The existing browser encrypted-deck path uses NIP-59 plumbing, and the production relay advertises NIP-59.","The production relay advertises NIP-65. Pylon planning includes publishing its selected relays as a NIP-65 list.","The production relay advertises NIP-67 and sends trailing EOSE metadata. Coax message.coax accepts bounded trailing EOSE values.","The production relay advertises NIP-70. The Coax relay has AUTH plumbing but not this complete protected-event policy.","The production relay advertises NIP-77. The Coax replacement roadmap includes a separate synchronization implementation.","The production relay advertises NIP-94 and can carry file metadata records.","Coax has tag extraction and a public request-field observer. The existing service and production relay advertise HTTP-auth capability."];
NG_GAPS :: [22]string.["Live project pages still trust the configured relay. Production signing keys wait for the secret audit and independent review.","Coax needs authorized deletion, durable tombstones and recovery that cannot resurrect deleted events.","Reading a reference does not verify the referenced event or implement an entire social client.","A supported_nips list is a declaration, not a conformance proof. Production and Coax relay capabilities differ.","A complete shared Coax private-message client and its NIP-59 composition remain unfinished.","A checksum catches damaged text. It does not authenticate a person, relay hint or referenced event.","The typed reader reads structure. Callers still verify the original signature and decide whose comments count.","Group membership, moderation, history visibility and permission checks need their own qualified Coax implementation.","Typed extraction and signature verification are separate. Project scope, allowed authors and complete live folding remain consumer responsibilities.","Expiration is not a deletion guarantee, and a relay cannot erase copies held elsewhere.","The demo builds an unsigned fixture template. It does not sign or send an AUTH event. Real keys remain behind the review gate.","These public test vectors are not permission to enter real keys. Production secret use still needs audit, target evidence and independent review.","COUNT responses and their limits need a Coax implementation before that relay advertises this NIP.","The complete ncryptsec backup format, normalization, secret erasure and production approval are not established. This is a partial foundation.","Search semantics, query cost, ordering and compatibility need differential tests before a Coax cutover.","The shared Coax gift-wrap and seal composition is not implemented. NIP-44 primitives alone do not finish NIP-59.","The capability declaration does not establish a complete Coax outbox-discovery or multi-relay synchronization client.","Parsing metadata is not proof of complete history. Catch-up still needs explicit limits, ties, retries and missing-record handling.","AUTH alone does not implement NIP-70. The event author must be bound to the authenticated connection under the protected-event rules.","The shared Coax stack does not yet provide NIP-77 reconciliation. EOSE and ordinary pagination are different mechanisms.","The shared Coax stack has no complete file-metadata consumer or download-integrity flow yet. A signed URL does not establish file availability.","The demo compares supplied fields only. It does not verify an event, reserve replay IDs, authorize a request or create a session."];
NG_SCOPE :: [22]string.["The captured event and altered copies run through the shared event reader and signature verifier.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","A public synthetic tag fixture runs through the shared standard-tag reader. No event signature is checked here.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","A public example runs through the shared NIP-19 decoder, including checksum and output-size refusals.","Synthetic comment tags run through the shared typed reader. Scope shape is not signature or permission.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","Synthetic repository tags run through the shared typed reader. It does not verify an event signature.","The shared relay expiration predicate runs at explicit fixture times. No event is published or deleted.","The shared challenge/template functions run on public fixtures. No key is entered and no AUTH is sent.","The shared decryptor reads a pinned upstream public vector. Changed or truncated ciphertext must refuse.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","The existing scrypt buffer-admission helper checks public fixture addresses and sizes. No password is derived.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","This demo reads a frozen public NIP-11 capability document. It does not execute this NIP on a relay.","The existing observer compares public fixture fields. Matching fields are not authenticated HTTP access."];
